+# Make Udgam maths tools (any class)
 
 The same as `.claude/commands/gen-tools.md`; both are shortcuts into the runbook.
 
-1. Read `udgam_maths_claude.md` (the runbook) and follow its flow, steps 0 to 8, for the chapter named in
-   the request. With a SLOT_ID, make only that slot ("make ONE tool"). With `lean`, use the lean mode
